<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HMD Remote Control</title>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/peerjs@1.5.2/dist/peerjs.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e);
            color: #fff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #ff0033;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 51, 0.5);
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .card h2 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #ff0033;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .video-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
        }

        video {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .placeholder {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100%;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0033, #cc0029);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(255, 0, 51, 0.4);
        }

        .btn:disabled {
            background: #333;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
            box-shadow: none;
        }

        .btn-stop {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4444, #cc0000);
        }

        .status {
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .status.connected {
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            color: #22c55e;
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
        }

        .status.disconnected {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
            color: #ef4444;
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }

        .message-box {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 100px;
        }

        .bluetooth-list {
            max-height: 200px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .bluetooth-device {
            padding: 10px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .bluetooth-device:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 0, 51, 0.2);
        }

        .info {
            background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.3);
            color: #ffc107;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .limitations {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .limitations h3 {
            color: #ff0033;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .limitations ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .limitations li {
            padding: 5px 0;
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .limitations li:before {
            content: "⚠ ";
            color: #ffc107;
        }

        .mode-selector {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .mode-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 200px;
        }

        .mode-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 0, 51, 0.2);
            border-color: #ff0033;
        }

        .mode-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff0033, #cc0029);
            border-color: #ff0033;
        }

        .connection-info {
            background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.3);
            color: #ffc107;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .connection-id {
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 18px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            display: inline-block;
            user-select: all;
        }

        .remote-video-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .remote-video-container video {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .hidden {
            display: none !important;
        }

        .control-panel {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .control-panel h3 {
            color: #ff0033;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .control-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .control-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .control-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 0, 51, 0.3);
            border-color: #ff0033;
        }

        .screenshot-preview {
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 200px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            display: none;
        }

        .volume-slider {
            width: 100%;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .notification {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 0, 51, 0.9);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            z-index: 2000;
            animation: slideIn 0.3s ease;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from {
                transform: translateX(100%);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                transform: translateX(0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🎮 HMD Remote Control</h1>
        
        <div class="info">
            <strong>ℹ️ Mode:</strong> Sélectionnez HÔTE (PC) ou VIEWER (Tablette)
        </div>

        <div class="mode-selector">
            <button class="mode-btn" onclick="selectMode('host')" id="hostModeBtn">🖥️ HÔTE (PC)</button>
            <button class="mode-btn" onclick="selectMode('viewer')" id="viewerModeBtn">📱 VIEWER (Tablette)</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Host Mode -->
        <div id="hostMode" class="hidden">
            <div class="connection-info">
                <div>Votre ID de connexion:</div>
                <div class="connection-id" id="hostId">Génération en cours...</div>
                <div style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 10px;">Partagez cet ID avec votre tablette</div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid">
                <!-- Webcam Section -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>📷 Webcam (Partagée)</h2>
                    <div class="video-container">
                        <div id="webcamPlaceholder" class="placeholder">Webcam désactivée</div>
                        <video id="webcamVideo" autoplay muted playsinline style="display: none;"></video>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="startWebcam()">🎥 Activer Webcam</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-stop" onclick="stopWebcam()" style="display: none;" id="stopWebcamBtn">⏹️ Arrêter</button>
                    <div id="webcamStatus" class="status disconnected">❌ Déconnecté</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Screen Share Section -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>🖥️ Écran (Partagé)</h2>
                    <div class="video-container">
                        <div id="screenPlaceholder" class="placeholder">Partage d'écran désactivé</div>
                        <video id="screenVideo" autoplay muted playsinline style="display: none;"></video>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="startScreenShare()">📤 Partager l'écran</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-stop" onclick="stopScreenShare()" style="display: none;" id="stopScreenBtn">⏹️ Arrêter</button>
                    <div id="screenStatus" class="status disconnected">❌ Déconnecté</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Microphone Section -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>🎤 Micro (Partagé)</h2>
                    <div class="video-container">
                        <div id="microPlaceholder" class="placeholder">Micro désactivé</div>
                        <audio id="microAudio" autoplay muted style="display: none;"></audio>
                        <canvas id="audioVisualizer" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display: none;"></canvas>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="startMicrophone()">🎤 Activer Micro</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-stop" onclick="stopMicrophone()" style="display: none;" id="stopMicroBtn">⏹️ Arrêter</button>
                    <div id="microStatus" class="status disconnected">❌ Déconnecté</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <h2>📡 Statut de connexion</h2>
                <div id="connectionStatus" class="status disconnected">❌ En attente de connexion...</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Viewer Mode -->
        <div id="viewerMode" class="hidden">
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <h2>🔗 Connexion au PC</h2>
                <input type="text" id="hostIdInput" placeholder="Entrez l'ID du PC" style="width: 100%; padding: 15px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; outline: none;">
                <button class="btn" onclick="connectToHost()">🔴 Se connecter</button>
                <div id="viewerConnectionStatus" class="status disconnected" style="margin-top: 10px;">❌ Non connecté</div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid">
                <!-- Remote Webcam -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>📷 Webcam du PC</h2>
                    <div class="remote-video-container">
                        <div id="remoteWebcamPlaceholder" class="placeholder">En attente du flux...</div>
                        <video id="remoteWebcamVideo" autoplay playsinline style="display: none;"></video>
                    </div>
                    <div id="remoteWebcamStatus" class="status disconnected">❌ Non connecté</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Remote Screen -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>🖥️ Écran du PC</h2>
                    <div class="remote-video-container">
                        <div id="remoteScreenPlaceholder" class="placeholder">En attente du flux...</div>
                        <video id="remoteScreenVideo" autoplay playsinline style="display: none;"></video>
                    </div>
                    <div id="remoteScreenStatus" class="status disconnected">❌ Non connecté</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Remote Microphone -->
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>🎤 Micro du PC</h2>
                    <div class="remote-video-container">
                        <div id="remoteMicroPlaceholder" class="placeholder">En attente du flux audio...</div>
                        <audio id="remoteMicroAudio" autoplay style="display: none;"></audio>
                        <canvas id="remoteAudioVisualizer" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display: none;"></canvas>
                    </div>
                    <div id="remoteMicroStatus" class="status disconnected">❌ Non connecté</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Control Panel -->
            <div class="control-panel">
                <h3>🎛️ Contrôles supplémentaires</h3>
                <div class="control-grid">
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="captureScreenshot()">📸 Capture d'écran</button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="toggleFullscreen()">🖥️ Plein écran</button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendAlert()">🔔 Envoyer alerte</button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="requestSystemInfo()">💻 Infos système</button>
                </div>
                
                <div class="control-grid" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="openRemoteURL()">🌐 Ouvrir URL</button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="speakText()">🗣️ Texte vers voix</button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSound()">🎵 Jouer son</button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="triggerDownload()">📥 Télécharger fichier</button>
                </div>
                
                <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <label>🔊 Volume système</label>
                    <input type="range" class="volume-slider" id="volumeSlider" min="0" max="100" value="50" onchange="adjustVolume(this.value)">
                    <div id="volumeValue" style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888;">50%</div>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <label>💬 Message sur le PC</label>
                    <input type="text" id="remoteMessageInput" placeholder="Message à afficher..." style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-top: 5px; outline: none;">
                    <button class="btn" onclick="sendRemoteMessage()" style="margin-top: 10px;">📤 Envoyer message</button>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <label>🌐 URL à ouvrir sur le PC</label>
                    <input type="text" id="remoteURLInput" placeholder="https://..." style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-top: 5px; outline: none;">
                    <button class="btn" onclick="openRemoteURL()" style="margin-top: 10px;">🌐 Ouvrir URL</button>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <label>🗣️ Texte à prononcer</label>
                    <input type="text" id="speakTextInput" placeholder="Texte à prononcer..." style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-top: 5px; outline: none;">
                    <button class="btn" onclick="speakText()" style="margin-top: 10px;">🗣️ Prononcer</button>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <img id="screenshotPreview" class="screenshot-preview" alt="Capture d'écran">
                    <button id="downloadScreenshot" class="btn" onclick="downloadScreenshot()" style="display: none; margin-top: 10px;">💾 Télécharger capture</button>
                </div>

                <div id="systemInfo" style="margin-top: 15px; padding: 10px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; display: none; font-size: 12px;"></div>

                <!-- Sound Effects Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <h3 style="color: #ff0033; margin-bottom: 15px;">🔊 Effets Sonores sur le PC</h3>
                    <div class="control-grid">
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('error')">❌ Erreur Windows</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('notification')">🔔 Notification</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('success')">✅ Succès</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('alarm')">⏰ Alarme</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('laser')">⚡ Laser</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('explosion')">💥 Explosion</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('coin')">🪙 Mario Coin</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('jump')">🦘 Mario Jump</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('powerup')">⭐ Power-up</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('gameover')">💀 Game Over</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('laugh')">😂 Rire</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="playSoundEffect('applause')">👏 Applaudissements</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Virtual Keyboard Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <h3 style="color: #ff0033; margin-bottom: 15px;">⌨️ Clavier Virtuel</h3>
                    <textarea id="virtualKeyboardInput" placeholder="Tapez votre texte ici..." style="width: 100%; padding: 15px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; outline: none; resize: vertical; min-height: 80px;"></textarea>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="sendVirtualKeyboardText()">📤 Envoyer le texte au PC</button>
                    <div class="control-grid" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVirtualKey('Enter')">↵ Enter</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVirtualKey('Backspace')">⌫ Backspace</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVirtualKey('Space')">␣ Space</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVirtualKey('Tab')">⇥ Tab</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVirtualKey('Escape')">⎋ Esc</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVirtualKey('Delete')">Del</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Video Control Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <h3 style="color: #ff0033; margin-bottom: 15px;">📺 Contrôle Vidéo</h3>
                    <div class="control-grid">
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('play')">▶️ Play</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('pause')">⏸️ Pause</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('stop')">⏹️ Stop</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('fullscreen')">🖥️ Fullscreen</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('mute')">🔇 Mute</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('volume_up')">🔊 Volume +</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('volume_down')">🔉 Volume -</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('forward')">⏩ Forward</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="sendVideoControl('rewind')">⏪ Rewind</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- File Transfer Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <h3 style="color: #ff0033; margin-bottom: 15px;">📁 Transfert de Fichiers</h3>
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                        <label style="color: #fff; margin-bottom: 5px; display: block;">📤 Upload vers le PC</label>
                        <input type="file" id="fileUpload" style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                        <button class="btn" onclick="uploadFile()">📤 Envoyer le fichier</button>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label style="color: #fff; margin-bottom: 5px; display: block;">📥 Download depuis le PC</label>
                        <input type="text" id="downloadFilename" placeholder="Nom du fichier à télécharger..." style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; outline: none;">
                        <button class="btn" onclick="requestFileDownload()">📥 Demander le fichier</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- System Info Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <h3 style="color: #ff0033; margin-bottom: 15px;">💻 Informations Système</h3>
                    <div class="control-grid">
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="requestSystemInfo()">📊 CPU/RAM</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="requestBatteryInfo()">🔋 Batterie</button>
                        <button class="control-btn" onclick="requestNetworkInfo()">📡 Réseau</button>
                    </div>
                    <div id="systemInfoDisplay" style="margin-top: 15px; padding: 15px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; display: none; font-size: 13px; color: #fff;"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Image Display Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <h3 style="color: #ff0033; margin-bottom: 15px;">🖼️ Afficher une Image</h3>
                    <input type="text" id="imageUrlInput" placeholder="URL de l'image..." style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; outline: none;">
                    <button class="btn" onclick="displayImageOnScreen()">🖼️ Afficher l'image</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-stop" onclick="hideImageFromScreen()" style="margin-top: 10px;">❌ Masquer l'image</button>
                </div>

                <!-- Admin Info Section -->
                <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: rgba(255, 0, 51, 0.1); border: 2px solid #ff0033; border-radius: 8px;">
                    <h3 style="color: #ff0033; margin-bottom: 15px;">🔐 Admin Info</h3>
                    <input type="password" id="adminPassword" placeholder="Mot de passe admin..." style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; outline: none;">
                    <button class="btn" onclick="checkAdminPassword()">🔓 Accéder aux infos</button>
                    <div id="adminInfoDisplay" style="margin-top: 15px; padding: 15px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; display: none; font-size: 13px; color: #fff;"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="limitations">
            <h3>⚠️ Instructions</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>PC (Hôte):</strong> Cliquez sur "HÔTE", activez webcam/écran, partagez l'ID</li>
                <li><strong>Tablette (Viewer):</strong> Cliquez sur "VIEWER", entrez l'ID du PC</li>
                <li>Les deux appareils doivent être connectés à internet</li>
                <li>Utilisez Chrome ou Edge pour le meilleur support</li>
                <li>Nécessite HTTPS pour certaines fonctionnalités</li>
            </ul>
            
            <h3>🎛️ Fonctionnalités disponibles</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>✅ Capture d'écran:</strong> Fonctionne quand le partage d'écran est actif</li>
                <li><strong>✅ Plein écran:</strong> Fonctionne sur les vidéos</li>
